-activities";}}s:5:"image";s:50:"WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-20-at-17.36.02_f896d14b.jpg";}s:34:"2a0345b93215bb0df3279697672fb3dasc";a:2:{s:5:"title";s:10:"Membership";s:8:"subtitle";s:42:"How to join or renew your APMIA membership";}s:34:"655569b8792c03d1499db49b3a5caa38sc";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:4:"Home";s:12:"body_classes";s:4:"home";s:7:"content";a:2:{s:5:"items";s:13:"@self.modular";s:5:"order";a:2:{s:2:"by";s:7:"default";s:3:"dir";s:3:"asc";}}}s:34:"a2216b0dc8110d1d0775a5b24c69bebesc";a:6:{s:5:"title";s:11:"Latest News";s:4:"menu";s:11:"Latest News";s:7:"eyebrow";s:13:"Stay informed";s:6:"source";s:5:"/news";s:5:"limit";i:6;s:12:"button_label";s:8:"All news";}s:34:"5be1497303cae895c5fb680f97d66f6dsc";a:6:{s:5:"title";s:58:"The pivotal link between government and the stone industry";s:4:"menu";s:5:"About";s:7:"eyebrow";s:11:"About APMIA";s:12:"button_label";s:18:"Read more about us";s:10:"button_url";s:6:"/about";s:5:"image";s:27:"apmia-pak-m-g-estimate.jpeg";}s:34:"521176a181855ea10b8f7aa824ae44basc";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:16:"Vision & Mission";s:4:"menu";s:16:"Vision & Mission";s:6:"panels";a:2:{i:0;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:5:"globe";s:5:"title";s:6:"Vision";s:4:"text";s:301:"To position Pakistan as a global leader in the dimension stone sector through innovative practices, sustainable processes, efficient transportation, value-added processing, robust exports, and strategic international partnerships, all achieved through industry, academia, and government collaboration.";}i:1;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:8:"landmark";s:5:"title";s:7:"Mission";s:4:"text";s:498:"Drawing on our historic role as the registered association under DGTO since 1985, representing the dimension stone sector within Pakistan's Federal Ministry of Commerce, APMIA is committed to a multifaceted mission. This includes modernizing marble and granite mining, promoting sustainability, improving transportation, fostering innovation in processing, expanding global presence, facilitating collaboration among stakeholders, forging international partnerships, and driving sustainable growth.";}}}s:34:"3e5c2a9b035a0132c337ada86f53eeaasc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:36:"Questions about APMIA or membership?";s:4:"menu";s:12:"Get in touch";s:4:"text";s:63:"Our Islamabad office is open Monday to Saturday, 10 am to 5 pm.";s:12:"button_label";s:10:"Contact us";s:10:"button_url";s:8:"/contact";s:13:"button2_label";s:22:"Membership information";s:11:"button2_url";s:11:"/membership";}s:34:"72df3d40269b389a9fcc71f2a826cc92sc";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:4:"Hero";s:4:"menu";s:4:"Hero";s:8:"autoplay";i:6;s:6:"slides";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:"image";s:12:"mining2.jpeg";s:7:"eyebrow";s:6:"Mining";s:5:"title";s:15:"Advanced Mining";s:4:"text";s:124:"Promote innovative, safe, and eco-conscious mining practices to optimize resource use while minimizing environmental impact.";s:12:"button_label";s:11:"About APMIA";s:10:"button_url";s:6:"/about";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:"image";s:15:"tranport-1.jpeg";s:7:"eyebrow";s:9:"Transport";s:5:"title";s:19:"Efficient Transport";s:4:"text";s:105:"Advocate for improved transportation infrastructure, reducing costs and ensuring smooth product movement.";s:12:"button_label";s:11:"Latest news";s:10:"button_url";s:5:"/news";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:"image";s:17:"processing-1.jpeg";s:7:"eyebrow";s:10:"Processing";s:5:"title";s:21:"Processing Excellence";s:4:"text";s:123:"Foster innovation and collaboration to enhance product quality and global competitiveness in marble and granite processing.";s:12:"button_label";s:22:"Research & Development";s:10:"button_url";s:30:"/news/research-and-development";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:"image";s:7:"1-1.jpg";s:7:"eyebrow";s:16:"Marble & Granite";s:5:"title";s:26:"Pakistan's Dimension Stone";s:4:"text";s:90:"The voice of the dimension stone sector under the Federal Ministry of Commerce since 1985.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Explore the gallery";s:10:"button_url";s:8:"/gallery";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:"image";s:7:"2-1.jpg";s:7:"eyebrow";s:16:"Global Expansion";s:5:"title";s:20:"Reaching New Markets";s:4:"text";s:100:"Identify and access new international markets, boosting exports and contributing to economic growth.";s:12:"button_label";s:10:"Contact us";s:10:"button_url";s:8:"/contact";}}}s:34:"37073aa56511dc85facb8e42d66dec10sc";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:10:"Objectives";s:4:"menu";s:10:"Objectives";s:7:"eyebrow";s:16:"What we work for";s:5:"items";a:8:{i:0;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:8:"mountain";s:5:"title";s:15:"Advanced Mining";s:4:"text";s:124:"Promote innovative, safe, and eco-conscious mining practices to optimize resource use while minimizing environmental impact.";}i:1;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:5:"truck";s:5:"title";s:19:"Efficient Transport";s:4:"text";s:105:"Advocate for improved transportation infrastructure, reducing costs and ensuring smooth product movement.";}i:2;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:3:"cog";s:5:"title";s:21:"Processing Excellence";s:4:"text";s:123:"Foster innovation and collaboration to enhance product quality and global competitiveness in marble and granite processing.";}i:3;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:5:"globe";s:5:"title";s:16:"Global Expansion";s:4:"text";s:100:"Identify and access new international markets, boosting exports and contributing to economic growth.";}i:4;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:5:"users";s:5:"title";s:17:"Collaboration Hub";s:4:"text";s:111:"Facilitate strong partnerships among industry, academia, and government to drive innovation and sustainability.";}i:5;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:4:"leaf";s:5:"title";s:20:"Sustainability Focus";s:4:"text";s:91:"Promote eco-friendly practices for environmental stewardship and long-term industry growth.";}i:6;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:8:"landmark";s:5:"title";s:17:"Historical Legacy";s:4:"text";s:140:"Preserve and celebrate APMIA's historic legacy as the voice of the dimension stone sector under the Federal Ministry of Commerce since 1985.";}i:7;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:9:"handshake";s:5:"title";s:26:"International Partnerships";s:4:"text";s:105:"Develop linkages with relevant international trade bodies to foster global cooperation and market access.";}}}s:34:"b96430